# Yocto build directories. The entire build/ tree is generated output
# (downloaded sources, sstate cache, tmp/work, and the rendered
# build/conf/*.conf that setup-env regenerates from the templates in
# layers/meta-tegrademo/conf/templates/<distro>/). The source of truth
# for the configurable templates lives there, not under build/, so the
# whole build/ tree is untracked and ignored here. The build-*/ entries
# below cover alternate BUILDDIRs created with `. setup-env <name>`.
build/
build-*/

# to_xfs.py output: XFS-converted tegraflash tarballs written to the
# repo root by default. These are flashing artifacts, not source.
*.tegraflash.xfs.tar.zst
*.tegraflash-tar.zst
*~
*.pyc
*.pyo
